        "html": "\n<main class=\"leaderboards-page\" data-leaderboard-page data-progression-page=\"leaderboards\" data-companion-context=\"leaderboards\" data-companion-copy=\"Your completed Wicked Bites runs can be compared in this browser. Connected rankings are not active.\" aria-labelledby=\"leaderboards-title\">\n  <nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a href=\"/play/\">Play</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Leaderboards</span></nav>\n  <section class=\"wo002-play-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"leaderboards-title\" data-companion-context=\"leaderboards\" data-companion-copy=\"This board uses only completed runs saved by the website in this browser.\" data-companion-reaction=\"reward\">\n    <div class=\"wo002-play-hero__copy\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">TOADAL FEAST &middot; YOUR BROWSER</p><span class=\"chip preview\">GUEST-LOCAL</span>\n      <h1 id=\"leaderboards-title\">Leaderboards</h1>\n      <p>Review completed Wicked Bites scores stored by this website in this browser. These runs do not compare players or establish a public rank.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--primary\" href=\"/player/wicked-bites/\">Play Wicked Bites <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"wo002-play-proof\" aria-label=\"Personal best summary\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">PERSONAL BEST</span><strong data-leaderboard-personal-best data-local-score-best data-game-id=\"wicked-bites\">&mdash;</strong><p>Wicked Bites &middot; this browser</p><small data-leaderboard-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">No completed run recorded in this browser.</small></aside>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"leaderboard-controls\" aria-label=\"Leaderboard controls\">\n    <label>Game\n      <select data-leaderboard-game aria-label=\"Choose a score-enabled game\">\n        <option value=\"wicked-bites\" selected>Wicked Bites &middot; browser preview</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <label>Scope\n      <select data-leaderboard-scope aria-label=\"Choose leaderboard scope\">\n        <option value=\"browser-local\" selected>This browser &middot; guest local</option>\n        <option value=\"global\" disabled>Global &middot; Coming Soon</option>\n        <option value=\"friends\" disabled>Friends &middot; Coming Soon</option>\n        <option value=\"pond\" disabled>Pond &middot; Coming Soon</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <p>The current preview does not send mode or ruleset metadata, so there is no mode filter.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"leaderboard-results\" aria-labelledby=\"local-runs-title\">\n    <header class=\"wo002-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">COMPLETED RUNS</p><h2 id=\"local-runs-title\">This browser</h2></div><span class=\"progression-local-badge\">Guest &middot; this browser</span></header>\n    <div class=\"leaderboard-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable local Wicked Bites score table\">\n      <table class=\"leaderboard-table\" data-leaderboard-table data-local-score-game=\"wicked-bites\">\n        <caption>Completed Wicked Bites runs retained by this website in this browser, sorted by score. This table does not compare players.</caption>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Rank</th><th scope=\"col\">Player or character</th><th scope=\"col\">Score</th><th scope=\"col\">Context</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody data-leaderboard-rows>\n          <tr data-leaderboard-empty><td colspan=\"4\">No completed Wicked Bites scores are saved in this browser yet.</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"leaderboard-empty-note\">Only validated completed scores belong here. Live score updates do not create rows.</p>\n    <p><a class=\"button-link button-link--primary\" href=\"/player/wicked-bites/\">Play the preview and set a browser-local best <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wo002-detail-facts leaderboard-future-state\" aria-label=\"Connected leaderboard availability\">\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"leaderboards\" data-companion-copy=\"Global, friends, and Pond boards wait for a connected and configured service.\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">CONNECTED RANKINGS</p><h2>Global, friends &amp; Pond</h2>\n      <p>Coming Soon. No connected leaderboard service or player identity is active here. Browser-local scores are not submitted to a server and no opponents or ranks are simulated.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">FEAST PASS</p><h2>Website progress stays local</h2><p>Scores do not automatically award XP, Sparks, Treats, badges, or account status. Any future game quest needs its own configured event and reward.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/feast-pass/\">View Feast Pass <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">PLAY MORE</p><h2>Back to the catalog</h2><p>Wicked Bites is the only browser game currently connected to the website score bridge. Other listings keep their own preview, held, or concept state.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/play/\">Browse browser games <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></article>\n  </section>\n\n  <details class=\"leaderboard-disclosure\"><summary>About local scores and privacy</summary><p>Scores shown here are guest-local website progression for this browser. The website uses the validated game score/completion messages and does not inspect the cartridge save. Clearing website progression clears website scores only. Global, friends, and Pond rankings need a connected identity and service and remain unavailable.</p></details>\n\n  <aside class=\"toadal-companion\" data-companion data-zone=\"hero\" aria-label=\"Toadal contextual helper\"><div class=\"companion-panel\" id=\"toadal-companion-panel\" data-companion-panel><p class=\"companion-label\">TOADAL SAYS</p><p class=\"companion-message\" data-companion-speech aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">Your completed Wicked Bites runs can be compared in this browser. Connected rankings are not active.</p></div><button class=\"companion-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-companion-toggle aria-controls=\"toadal-companion-panel\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Minimize Toadal helper\"><img class=\"companion-image\" data-companion-image src=\"/assets/images/characters/toadal-victory.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Minimize Toadal helper</span></button></aside>\n</main>"
